    <text type="letter">
        <body>
            <div type="writingSession">
                <pb n="1"/>
                <opener><fw place="left" type="adressline"><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3521"
                            type="person">Evald B. Lawson</rs>
                        <lb/>Upsala College <lb/><rs ref="#tillich_place_id__866" type="place">East
                            Orange</rs>, <rs ref="#tillich_place_id__867" type="place">N.
                        J.</rs></fw><dateline><date when="1946-07-11">July 11,
                        1946</date></dateline><salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__3521"
                            type="person">President Lawson</rs>:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__829" type="person">Dr. Frederick
                            Haussman<supplied>n</supplied></rs> has asked me to write to you a
                    letter of recommendation.</p>
                <p>I have known <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__829" type="person">Dr.
                            Haussman<supplied>n</supplied></rs> for some years in his capacity as a
                    member of the New School for Social Research and through personal contacts. <rs
                        ref="#tillich_person_id__829" type="person">Dr.
                            Haussman<supplied>n</supplied></rs> has a large practical experience in
                    the economic field. At the same time he has both scholarly and educational
                    abilities which would make him a useful member of every economic department.
                    There will be no difficulty for him in adapting himself to college life. He is a
                    very sociable personality.</p>
                <p> His political attitude can be characterized as a liberal with conservative
                    elements. <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__829" type="person">Dr.
                            Haussman<supplied>n</supplied></rs> is also known to my collegue <rs
                        ref="#tillich_person_id__1390" type="person">Dr. Reinhold Niebuhr</rs>.</p>
                <closer><salute>Yours sincerely,</salute>
                    <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person">Paul Tillich</rs>
                        <lb/> Professor at Union Theological Seminary, <rs
                            ref="#tillich_place_id__319" type="place">New York
                    City</rs></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
